{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search for visible object, approach and take it, check properties, do specific task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = MoveToGetObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToTaskLocation    /> <SubTree ID = DoSpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToSearchLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    />",
